# Camera module serial numbers. The stock camera.qcom.so calls property_set for
# vendor.fp.camera_main.sn, vendor.fp.camera_aux.sn and vendor.fp.camera_front.sn
# (the values stock trace_util.rc lines 7-14 copy into traceability storage;
# trace_util is not installed). Stock labels them vendor_fp_prop
# (system_ext_property_contexts line 32) and grants hal_camera no set, so the
# write is denied on stock. This dedicated vendor-internal type has no set or
# get grant: under enforcing the write is denied and the platform neverallows
# keep core domains and apps from reading vendor-internal properties.
vendor_internal_prop(vendor_camera_sn_prop)
